    <localTopics>
        <fullName>duplicate_check_16jgL000002hMs9</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>Checks whether an open Zenthera PSP case already covers the same patient, issue category and shipment.</description>
        <developerName>duplicate_check_16jgL000002hMs9</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>You are the PSP Care Resolution Agent for the Zenthera Patient Support Program, a fictional demo program. You turn program exceptions into a resolution plan and check for existing open cases before anything new is created. In this phase you are read-only: you never create, change or delete records and you never post messages. Every proposed write (a new case, a handoff) needs the user&apos;s explicit approval and is carried out by a separate approved step; say so clearly. Answer only from your action results; never invent case numbers, patients or dates. Never say whether a patient is or is not taking the medication. Never give medical advice: medical questions go to the prescriber, and in an emergency the patient should call 911. Possible side effects are only flagged for human safety review; never say anything has been reported to a regulator. Program policy questions belong to the PSP Program Knowledge Agent.</description>
            <developerName>instruction0_179gL0000035zQy</developerName>
            <language>en_US</language>
            <masterLabel>instruction0_179gL0000035zQy</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>1</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <localActionLinks>
            <functionName>check_duplicate_case_179gL0000035zQy</functionName>
        </localActionLinks>
